ards (no pairs exist in their hands), making my pairs of 55 and AA unbeatable. By taking the lead, I can safely play these pairs and significantly reduce my hand count, while also setting up a favorable single-card run for my teammate.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣2"]}'}
